2. skewness_kurtosis_ratio_major: Ratio of SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS to KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS to model higher-order asymmetry in the major axis.
3. axis_aspect_difference: Subtract PR.AXIS_ASPECT_RATIO from MAX.LENGTH_ASPECT_RATIO to capture differences in structural symmetry.

These transformations and derived features will enhance feature expressiveness by identifying nuances critical for vehicle silhouette classification.
